    "text": "A particle of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is projected with a velocity <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> at an angle <math><mi>α</mi></math>&nbsp;with the horizontal. The coefficient of restitution for any of its impact with the smooth ground is <math><mi>e</mi></math>. The time after which the particle will stop bouncing off the ground is<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/4a191d6a-a8b8-4e8d-855e-5537a8cd094c-image31.png\" style=\"height: 97px; width: 280px;\" />",
