    "text": "<p>After each collision, the particle loses some part of its vertical velocity while its horizontal velocity remains unchanged.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
